      "preview": "{\"a2a_calls\": 22, \"answer\": \"Release complete. The payment button is integrated into the checkout page and works with the existing checkout flow.\\n\\nWhat shipped:\\n- web/index.html: checkout form (#checkout-form) with a payment method select (#method: card / bank_transfer), a Pay submit button (#pay-button), and an aria-live results region (#result).\\n- web/app.js: fetches GET /api/status and GET /api/cart, then on submit POSTs {cart, method} to /api/checkout, disables the button while in flight, re-enables it in finally, and renders either 'Payment <status>: $<amount> via <method>' or 'Payment failed: <error>' on non-OK responses.\\n- checkout_app/server.py: serves / and /app.js, exposes GET /api/status and GET /api/cart (server-provided demo cart with positive quantities), and maps create_checkout errors (KeyError/ValueError/TypeError/JSONDecodeError) to HTTP 400 JSON errors.\\n- run.py:...[+1058 chars]",
